<!DOCTYPE svg PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD SVG 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/Graphics/SVG/1.1/DTD/svg11.dtd">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="441px" height="981px" viewBox="-0.5 -0.5 441 981" content="&lt;mxfile host=&quot;www.iodraw.com&quot; agent=&quot;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/151.0.0.0&quot; version=&quot;24.7.17&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;diagram name=&quot;第 1 页&quot; id=&quot;McvMyDJYeai2nbM1TonE&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;mxGraphModel dx=&quot;681&quot; dy=&quot;645&quot; grid=&quot;1&quot; gridSize=&quot;10&quot; guides=&quot;1&quot; tooltips=&quot;1&quot; connect=&quot;1&quot; arrows=&quot;1&quot; fold=&quot;1&quot; page=&quot;1&quot; pageScale=&quot;1&quot; pageWidth=&quot;827&quot; pageHeight=&quot;1169&quot; math=&quot;0&quot; shadow=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;root&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;0&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-11&quot; style=&quot;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.75;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;&quot; edge=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot; source=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-1&quot; target=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-2&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry relative=&quot;1&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-1&quot; value=&quot;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;题面 ω=1.9806, c_z/c_θ∈[0,100000] + 附件3 问题4 行&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;a_z=1091.099,a_θ=7142.493,b_z=528.5018,b_θ=1655.909,f=1760,L=2140）+ 附件4 + P1 k_h + P5 派生(J_f,J_o,s₀,K_g)&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&quot; style=&quot;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;&quot; vertex=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry x=&quot;80&quot; y=&quot;40&quot; width=&quot;440&quot; height=&quot;70&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-2&quot; value=&quot;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;优化问题陈述：max P̄(c_z,c_θ) s.t. 0≤c_z,c_θ≤100000&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;目标口径：PTO 平均输出功率（题面无显式公式，物理口径交代）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;P̄ = ½c_z·ω²|Z_o−Z_f|² + ½c_θ·ω²|B−A|²（P4 双块解耦，各自 2×2 频域解）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&quot; style=&quot;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;&quot; vertex=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry x=&quot;80&quot; y=&quot;150&quot; width=&quot;440&quot; height=&quot;70&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-3&quot; value=&quot;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;垂荡块 1D 频域优化 P̄_z(c_z)&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;200 点对数扫描 + 单峰性&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;端点复核 + 精化→ c_z*_1d = 59152.91&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&quot; style=&quot;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;&quot; vertex=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry x=&quot;80&quot; y=&quot;260&quot; width=&quot;190&quot; height=&quot;80&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-4&quot; value=&quot;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;纵摇块 1D 频域优化 P̄_θ(c_θ)同结构；&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;单调上升 → 顶界候选 → c_θ*_1d → 100000（顶界）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&quot; style=&quot;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;&quot; vertex=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry x=&quot;330&quot; y=&quot;260&quot; width=&quot;190&quot; height=&quot;80&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-16&quot; style=&quot;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;&quot; edge=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot; source=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-5&quot; target=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-6&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry relative=&quot;1&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-5&quot; value=&quot;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;二维确定性粗网格扫描：81×81=6561 点（对数轴，含 0 边界）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;+ 可分离性验证（分解恒等 ~1e-16 + 脊结构 argmax 稳定） + 单峰性（两方向符号变化段 ≤1）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&quot; style=&quot;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;&quot; vertex=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry x=&quot;80&quot; y=&quot;380&quot; width=&quot;440&quot; height=&quot;70&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-17&quot; style=&quot;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;&quot; edge=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot; source=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-6&quot; target=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-7&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry relative=&quot;1&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-6&quot; value=&quot;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;局部加密 + 边界复核：&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;① 粗扫 top-5 → Powell 有界精化（对数坐标，±1 网格步邻域）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;② 四条边显式扫描（各 200 点 + 精化）+ 四个角点显式求值（P(0,0)=0）&amp;amp;nbsp; &amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;③ 边界最优判定：c_θ=1e5 边内最优 318.4464 ≥ 内部精化 318.4463→ c_θ* = 100000（顶界，约束域内最优候选）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&quot; style=&quot;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;&quot; vertex=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry x=&quot;80&quot; y=&quot;500&quot; width=&quot;440&quot; height=&quot;100&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-18&quot; style=&quot;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;&quot; edge=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot; source=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-7&quot; target=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-8&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry relative=&quot;1&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-7&quot; value=&quot;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;时域定案（零初值独立验证）：&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;① 稳态可达性：逐周期 DOP853 ≤400 周期，双判据 1e-7，末 10 周期均值(heave 104 周期 / pitch 89 周期收敛，vs 频域 6.4e-7/2.9e-9）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;② 双解法：相量初值核验（1e-13）+ 独立 RK4 增广（1e-4 级）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;③ c_z 方向时域五点 ×{0.8..1.2} → c_z*_td = 59152.05（rel 0.0015%）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&quot; style=&quot;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;&quot; vertex=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry x=&quot;80&quot; y=&quot;640&quot; width=&quot;440&quot; height=&quot;100&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-19&quot; style=&quot;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;&quot; edge=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot; source=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-8&quot; target=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-9&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry relative=&quot;1&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-8&quot; value=&quot;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;验证（失败-回退表，全绿）：退化对照 c_θ→0（0.000%/0.014% 回归 Q2）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&amp;lt;div&amp;gt;/ 网格收敛（0.013%）/ 频域残差（1.7e-14）/ 能量守恒（0 违反）/ 纵摇退化 α≡β≡0 / 角度 0.067 rad &amp;amp;lt; 0.1 rad / J_f ±20% 双口径&amp;amp;nbsp; （总功率 0.009% 不触发 + P_θ 自身 Δ±18-25% 已回查）&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt;&quot; style=&quot;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;&quot; vertex=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry x=&quot;80&quot; y=&quot;780&quot; width=&quot;440&quot; height=&quot;100&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-9&quot; value=&quot;输出：c_z*=59152.91 N·s/m, c_θ*=100000（顶界）, P_max=318.4464 W（约束域 [0,100000]² 内最优候选）功率组成：垂荡 318.3364 W（99.965%）+ 纵摇 0.1099 W（0.0345%）&quot; style=&quot;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;&quot; vertex=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry x=&quot;80&quot; y=&quot;920&quot; width=&quot;440&quot; height=&quot;100&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-10&quot; style=&quot;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=0.055;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;&quot; edge=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot; source=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-1&quot; target=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-2&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry relative=&quot;1&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-12&quot; style=&quot;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.75;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.419;entryY=0.002;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;&quot; edge=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot; source=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-2&quot; target=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-4&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry relative=&quot;1&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-13&quot; style=&quot;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.589;entryY=-0.012;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;&quot; edge=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot; source=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-2&quot; target=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-3&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry relative=&quot;1&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-14&quot; style=&quot;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.219;entryY=-0.006;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;&quot; edge=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot; source=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-3&quot; target=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-5&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry relative=&quot;1&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;        &lt;mxCell id=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-15&quot; style=&quot;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.786;entryY=0.022;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;&quot; edge=&quot;1&quot; parent=&quot;1&quot; source=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-4&quot; target=&quot;1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-5&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;mxGeometry relative=&quot;1&quot; as=&quot;geometry&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/mxCell&gt;&#10;      &lt;/root&gt;&#10;    &lt;/mxGraphModel&gt;&#10;  &lt;/diagram&gt;&#10;&lt;/mxfile&gt;&#10;"><defs/><g><g data-cell-id="0"><g data-cell-id="1"><g data-cell-id="1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-11"><g><path d="M 330 70 L 330 103.63" fill="none" stroke="rgb(0, 0, 0)" stroke-miterlimit="10" pointer-events="stroke"/><path d="M 330 108.88 L 326.5 101.88 L 330 103.63 L 333.5 101.88 Z" fill="rgb(0, 0, 0)" stroke="rgb(0, 0, 0)" stroke-miterlimit="10" pointer-events="all"/></g></g><g data-cell-id="1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-1"><g><rect x="0" y="0" width="440" height="70" fill="rgb(255, 255, 255)" stroke="rgb(0, 0, 0)" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g transform="translate(-0.5 -0.5)"><switch><foreignObject pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility" style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe center; justify-content: unsafe center; width: 438px; height: 1px; padding-top: 35px; margin-left: 1px;"><div data-drawio-colors="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); " style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0px; text-align: center;"><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;"><div>题面 ω=1.9806, c_z/c_θ∈[0,100000] + 附件3 问题4 行</div><div>a_z=1091.099,a_θ=7142.493,b_z=528.5018,b_θ=1655.909,f=1760,L=2140）+ 附件4 + P1 k_h + P5 派生(J_f,J_o,s₀,K_g)</div></div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="220" y="39" fill="rgb(0, 0, 0)" font-family="&quot;Helvetica&quot;" font-size="12px" text-anchor="middle">题面 ω=1.9806, c_z/c_θ∈[0,100000] + 附件3 问题4 行...</text></switch></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-2"><g><rect x="0" y="110" width="440" height="70" fill="rgb(255, 255, 255)" stroke="rgb(0, 0, 0)" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g transform="translate(-0.5 -0.5)"><switch><foreignObject pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility" style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe center; justify-content: unsafe center; width: 438px; height: 1px; padding-top: 145px; margin-left: 1px;"><div data-drawio-colors="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); " style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0px; text-align: center;"><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;"><div>优化问题陈述：max P̄(c_z,c_θ) s.t. 0≤c_z,c_θ≤100000</div><div>目标口径：PTO 平均输出功率（题面无显式公式，物理口径交代）</div><div>P̄ = ½c_z·ω²|Z_o−Z_f|² + ½c_θ·ω²|B−A|²（P4 双块解耦，各自 2×2 频域解）</div></div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="220" y="149" fill="rgb(0, 0, 0)" font-family="&quot;Helvetica&quot;" font-size="12px" text-anchor="middle">优化问题陈述：max P̄(c_z,c_θ) s.t. 0≤c_z,c_θ≤100000...</text></switch></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-3"><g><rect x="0" y="220" width="190" height="80" fill="rgb(255, 255, 255)" stroke="rgb(0, 0, 0)" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g transform="translate(-0.5 -0.5)"><switch><foreignObject pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility" style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe center; justify-content: unsafe center; width: 188px; height: 1px; padding-top: 260px; margin-left: 1px;"><div data-drawio-colors="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); " style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0px; text-align: center;"><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;"><div>垂荡块 1D 频域优化 P̄_z(c_z) </div><div>200 点对数扫描 + 单峰性</div><div>端点复核 + 精化→ c_z*_1d = 59152.91</div></div></div></div></foreignObject><text x="95" y="264" fill="rgb(0, 0, 0)" font-family="&quot;Helvetica&quot;" font-size="12px" text-anchor="middle">垂荡块 1D 频域优化 P̄_z(c_z)...</text></switch></g></g></g><g data-cell-id="1Og1Sy4L1hmdW7rZDvrz-4"><g><rect x="250" y="220" width="190" height="80" fill="rgb(255, 255, 255)" stroke="rgb(0, 0, 0)" pointer-events="all"/></g><g><g transform="translate(-0.5 -0.5)"><switch><foreignObject pointer-events="none" width="100%" height="100%" requiredFeatures="http://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/feature#Extensibility" style="overflow: visible; text-align: left;"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="display: flex; align-items: unsafe center; justify-content: unsafe center; width: 188px; height: 1px; padding-top: 260px; margin-left: 251px;"><div data-drawio-colors="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); " style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 0px; text-align: center;"><div style="display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.2; pointer-events: all; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;"><div>纵摇块 1D 频域优化